(6968348, 1051506, 82999, '<td valign="top">This is very good, but I can''t help but believe it could have been even better if it was processed a bit differently.  The lightness of her skin renders it pale, sort of flat.  Maybe a tad warmer, a bit more contrast.  BW?  Not sure.  But still very nice image.</td>', 'This is very good, but I can''t help but believe it could have been even better if it was processed a bit differently.  The lightness of her skin renders it pale, sort of flat.  Maybe a tad warmer, a bit more contrast.  BW?  Not sure.  But still very nice image.', '2013-02-01 00:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
