(6968867, 1052104, 54446, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Great detail and focus.  I understand why you would not (slight cw) rotate the image to square the horizon.  (Can''t even see the horizon, right?)  Superb composition.  It''s the landscape photog in me which feels off kilter because of the tilt.  But, the tilt is effective at emphasizing the bird interaction.  8</td>', 'Lovely image.  Great detail and focus.  I understand why you would not (slight cw) rotate the image to square the horizon.  (Can''t even see the horizon, right?)  Superb composition.  It''s the landscape photog in me which feels off kilter because of the tilt.  But, the tilt is effective at emphasizing the bird interaction.  8', '2013-02-01 09:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
