(6968980, 1049807, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the axtion.  Good use of dust in the air for the bg.  The hint of fence and fellow cowboys is a plus.  7</td>', 'Great capture of the axtion.  Good use of dust in the air for the bg.  The hint of fence and fellow cowboys is a plus.  7', '2013-02-01 11:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
