(6968983, 1049991, 54446, '<td valign="top">The path is too centered.  It''s a leading line, but when my eyes follow the path, I end up on the ridge.  Love the sky.  Not sure the landscape has elements of interest... possible because it''s sort of murky, underexposed.  7</td>', 'The path is too centered.  It''s a leading line, but when my eyes follow the path, I end up on the ridge.  Love the sky.  Not sure the landscape has elements of interest... possible because it''s sort of murky, underexposed.  7', '2013-02-01 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6968987, 1052057, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice craggy tree in the midst of other landscape.  The bush on the left seems to be blocking my view.  Looks like I might like the red rocks in warm light behind.  7</td>', 'Pretty nice craggy tree in the midst of other landscape.  The bush on the left seems to be blocking my view.  Looks like I might like the red rocks in warm light behind.  7', '2013-02-01 11:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
