(6969062, 1051449, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting of this cave.  Pretty interesting to see the wood framing... probably intended to prevent the roof from deteriorating further.  The lower half is interesting.  The top half is interesting.  The horizon is centered vertically.... which leaves the viewer in a quandary as to which half to direct attention.  7</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting of this cave.  Pretty interesting to see the wood framing... probably intended to prevent the roof from deteriorating further.  The lower half is interesting.  The top half is interesting.  The horizon is centered vertically.... which leaves the viewer in a quandary as to which half to direct attention.  7', '2013-02-01 12:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
