(6969477, 1049777, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''ve given this a 7.    It''s fabulously lit and the colors are... magnificent.  Brilliant image with that contrast against the black...  *contented sigh*<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m not a prude, but the "nudeness" detracts (for me) from the beautiful model and the fabulous light.<br/>I think with some filmy upper cloth, this could be a 10.<br/> <br/>I''d really like to hear what you think the nakedness brought to the image.<br/> <br/>(feel free to message me, if you like)</td>', 'I''ve given this a 7.    It''s fabulously lit and the colors are... magnificent.  Brilliant image with that contrast against the black...  *contented sigh*  I''m not a prude, but the "nudeness" detracts (for me) from the beautiful model and the fabulous light.I think with some filmy upper cloth, this could be a 10. I''d really like to hear what you think the nakedness brought to the image. (feel free to message me, if you like)', '2013-02-01 19:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
