(6969835, 1049933, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting, great title, rich in detail, good color mix - can''t say anything critical about it that wouldn''t be picking of the nits. Great capture.</td>', 'Perfect lighting, great title, rich in detail, good color mix - can''t say anything critical about it that wouldn''t be picking of the nits. Great capture.', '2013-02-02 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969836, 1051044, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another concept photo that not all might get, but I''m certain I know how this came about.  Very very subtle.  Great composition and capture - gotta give props where props are due - well done.</td>', 'Another concept photo that not all might get, but I''m certain I know how this came about.  Very very subtle.  Great composition and capture - gotta give props where props are due - well done.', '2013-02-02 10:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969837, 1051696, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant, great combinations of color and an almost perfect green which is the hardest of the colors to properly capture. Clean crisp composition and not overly busy. Another excellent entry. I''m getting tired of all these great images - making me look like a jerk. :&gt;)</td>', 'Simple and elegant, great combinations of color and an almost perfect green which is the hardest of the colors to properly capture. Clean crisp composition and not overly busy. Another excellent entry. I''m getting tired of all these great images - making me look like a jerk. :>)', '2013-02-02 10:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969838, 1051211, 60047, '<td valign="top">Cool capture. Great processing.</td>', 'Cool capture. Great processing.', '2013-02-02 10:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969839, 1051955, 60047, '<td valign="top">Her lips make this shot pop!</td>', 'Her lips make this shot pop!', '2013-02-02 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969840, 1051936, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is how I view portraits.  First, the model has to look like they are posed naturally.  Then I look for an honest face - you can tell when a model is being forced into expression and when that expression is natural and easy to produce for the model. After that, it''s the incidentals - how is the face related to body pose, is it relaxed or forced, etc. Then on to the photo technicals like exposure, saturation, composition, etc. In this instance, it''s simply perfect in all the categories - I can''t say it any differently. Well done.</td>', 'This is how I view portraits.  First, the model has to look like they are posed naturally.  Then I look for an honest face - you can tell when a model is being forced into expression and when that expression is natural and easy to produce for the model. After that, it''s the incidentals - how is the face related to body pose, is it relaxed or forced, etc. Then on to the photo technicals like exposure, saturation, composition, etc. In this instance, it''s simply perfect in all the categories - I can''t say it any differently. Well done.', '2013-02-02 10:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969841, 1052211, 135629, '<td valign="top">Great photo, awesome armageddon colors!</td>', 'Great photo, awesome armageddon colors!', '2013-02-02 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969842, 1050026, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s always easy to tell what the little ones are thinking because their emotions are so open and honest.  This image captures that perfectly. Excellent.</td>', 'It''s always easy to tell what the little ones are thinking because their emotions are so open and honest.  This image captures that perfectly. Excellent.', '2013-02-02 10:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
