(6969849, 1049826, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the color combinations and the framing. I have a little problem with the focus - it seems very soft - much softer than I would have liked.  However, it does work here - very nice image and a good composition.</td>', 'I like the color combinations and the framing. I have a little problem with the focus - it seems very soft - much softer than I would have liked.  However, it does work here - very nice image and a good composition.', '2013-02-02 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
