(6969859, 1049610, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you run into images that just seem too perfect.  In this case, the rather subdued great hall is broken up by the Monks color in a perfect candid pose. Damn this is a good one - certainly a contender for Winner and/or Top Three.</td>', 'Sometimes you run into images that just seem too perfect.  In this case, the rather subdued great hall is broken up by the Monks color in a perfect candid pose. Damn this is a good one - certainly a contender for Winner and/or Top Three.', '2013-02-02 10:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
