(6969973, 1050491, 65234, '<td valign="top">But a good bug, since she''s hunting for aphids.  I love having these in my garden!  Her shell looks almost painted here.  Very rich tones in the labybug and flower.  At first I thought the background was noisy but as I look more closely that seems to be texture.</td>', 'But a good bug, since she''s hunting for aphids.  I love having these in my garden!  Her shell looks almost painted here.  Very rich tones in the labybug and flower.  At first I thought the background was noisy but as I look more closely that seems to be texture.', '2013-02-02 12:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969974, 1049998, 65234, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene with rosy colors and soft light that do feel like dawn.  Kind of expect the fisherman to be holding still as everything else in the scene is, though.  Or all of him to be moving, so he seems completely ghostlike.</td>', 'A pretty scene with rosy colors and soft light that do feel like dawn.  Kind of expect the fisherman to be holding still as everything else in the scene is, though.  Or all of him to be moving, so he seems completely ghostlike.', '2013-02-02 12:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6969987, 1051758, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of elements in this -- accentuated by the black and white.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of elements in this -- accentuated by the black and white.', '2013-02-02 12:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
