(6970259, 1052050, 37845, '<td valign="top">Looking at this photo gives me a feeling of repulsion... because it makes me sad, angry, etc. That is the power of this photo... I dont like it, because the subject fills me with emotion. This photo is great because it forces that emotion in the viewer.</td>', 'Looking at this photo gives me a feeling of repulsion... because it makes me sad, angry, etc. That is the power of this photo... I dont like it, because the subject fills me with emotion. This photo is great because it forces that emotion in the viewer.', '2013-02-02 20:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
