(6970271, 1051506, 129512, '<td valign="top">I was wondering what kind of selfie you were going to submit. Lighting is great and the catch-light in your eyes draws me in. <br/> <br/>I only have one nitpick. It''s either my screen or otherwise but following the piece of hair by your right ear, there seems to be a black vertical line which bugs me. Like I said, I don''t know if it''s on purpose or just the angle of which I view the photo (which after changing my perspective it disappears)..<br/> <br/>Either way, Great Job!</td>', 'I was wondering what kind of selfie you were going to submit. Lighting is great and the catch-light in your eyes draws me in.  I only have one nitpick. It''s either my screen or otherwise but following the piece of hair by your right ear, there seems to be a black vertical line which bugs me. Like I said, I don''t know if it''s on purpose or just the angle of which I view the photo (which after changing my perspective it disappears).. Either way, Great Job!', '2013-02-02 21:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
