(6970519, 1051413, 43463, '<td valign="top">My feet keep a steady pace as I follow the poured road down the hill. Autumn chill carries the scent of crisp, maple leaves and the golden aromas wafting from the sugar shack. I quicken my pace this morning craving that rich, amber syrup poured over a hot stack of pancakes.</td>', 'My feet keep a steady pace as I follow the poured road down the hill. Autumn chill carries the scent of crisp, maple leaves and the golden aromas wafting from the sugar shack. I quicken my pace this morning craving that rich, amber syrup poured over a hot stack of pancakes.', '2013-02-03 10:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
