(6970633, 1052127, 113156, '<td valign="top">Feels strange to say that I love this because I know who it is, it is a remarkable portrait though in every sense and your choice of composition and processing couldn''t have been better, your eyes seem to want to teach us some deep secret that we may find disturbing, I don''t mind being disturbed so a 10 it is.</td>', 'Feels strange to say that I love this because I know who it is, it is a remarkable portrait though in every sense and your choice of composition and processing couldn''t have been better, your eyes seem to want to teach us some deep secret that we may find disturbing, I don''t mind being disturbed so a 10 it is.', '2013-02-03 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
