(6971163, 1052208, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice title!  I wonder the significance of the colors of their dresses.  Nice catch!</td>', 'Nice title!  I wonder the significance of the colors of their dresses.  Nice catch!', '2013-02-04 01:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971164, 1051114, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks so resolute and determined!!  (And yet the first thing I thought of was "why are you letting a child walk down the middle of the road??  I''m guessing it''s either closed or infrequently used.)  I like your choice of toning/processing, too.  But mostly I like her posture and clenched fist.  So determined.</td>', 'She looks so resolute and determined!!  (And yet the first thing I thought of was "why are you letting a child walk down the middle of the road??  I''m guessing it''s either closed or infrequently used.)  I like your choice of toning/processing, too.  But mostly I like her posture and clenched fist.  So determined.', '2013-02-04 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971166, 1051312, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting pasttime.  Watching sand dunes.  Can''t say I''ve tried that yet! The dog looks as though he''s enjoying the day.</td>', 'An interesting pasttime.  Watching sand dunes.  Can''t say I''ve tried that yet! The dog looks as though he''s enjoying the day.', '2013-02-04 01:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971168, 1051663, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!</td>', 'Wonderful!!', '2013-02-04 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971196, 1051515, 101581, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I dated a girl who looked like this once :-)<br/>Very funny.<br/>Not sure I completely understand the PP but it has a certain appeal I think.</td>', 'I''m sure I dated a girl who looked like this once :-)Very funny.Not sure I completely understand the PP but it has a certain appeal I think.', '2013-02-04 03:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971217, 1050830, 61396, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to grasp, so first, my condolences. The portrait orientation is magical. It helps maintain some distance from the emotional state that the image conveys. This piece is worth framing and hanging.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>p.s. this reminds me of the precise work of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=7778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">zeuszen</a></td>', 'It took me a while to grasp, so first, my condolences. The portrait orientation is magical. It helps maintain some distance from the emotional state that the image conveys. This piece is worth framing and hanging.   p.s. this reminds me of the precise work of  zeuszen', '2013-02-04 03:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971225, 1049802, 101581, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I am the best person to critique your work.<br/>So with the greatest respect it maybe looks a little over saturated with maybe a tweak needed in the brightness and / contrast.<br/>Nice shot though.<br/>Is it Central Park ?</td>', 'I am not sure I am the best person to critique your work.So with the greatest respect it maybe looks a little over saturated with maybe a tweak needed in the brightness and / contrast.Nice shot though.Is it Central Park ?', '2013-02-04 03:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971227, 1049611, 101581, '<td valign="top">Interesting sky !<br/>So that''s good.<br/>I often miss that in my shots.<br/>Nice !</td>', 'Interesting sky !So that''s good.I often miss that in my shots.Nice !', '2013-02-04 03:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971231, 1051908, 101581, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I am the best person to critique anyone''s work so with the greatest respect,<br/>It maybe could do with a sharper focal point with a more subtle use of the colours. I''m sure that the colours are vibrant as it looks like a beautifully exotic  place but in my very humble opinion the huts in the distance look perhaps a little blown and over saturated. <br/>I still gave it a 5. Even though I promised myself that 5''s were a cop out. But this image was one of the few that I really couldn''t decide on. Well done though.</td>', 'Not sure that I am the best person to critique anyone''s work so with the greatest respect,It maybe could do with a sharper focal point with a more subtle use of the colours. I''m sure that the colours are vibrant as it looks like a beautifully exotic  place but in my very humble opinion the huts in the distance look perhaps a little blown and over saturated. I still gave it a 5. Even though I promised myself that 5''s were a cop out. But this image was one of the few that I really couldn''t decide on. Well done though.', '2013-02-04 04:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971233, 1052212, 101581, '<td valign="top">This year I am trying more macro work.<br/>I doubt I''ll be producing anything this good for a while.<br/>Nice capture, well done.</td>', 'This year I am trying more macro work.I doubt I''ll be producing anything this good for a while.Nice capture, well done.', '2013-02-04 04:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6971235, 1050318, 101581, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice portrait with nice detail, dynamic range and emotion.<br/>I scored this on my iPad first time round.<br/>Then I revisited it on my Mac. It might be the screen but I liked it a lot more on the latter. <br/>I moved it to a 7.<br/>Well done, Sorry I missed it first time round.</td>', 'This is a really nice portrait with nice detail, dynamic range and emotion.I scored this on my iPad first time round.Then I revisited it on my Mac. It might be the screen but I liked it a lot more on the latter. I moved it to a 7.Well done, Sorry I missed it first time round.', '2013-02-04 04:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
