(6973355, 1049991, 101256, '<td valign="top">An image that takes some time to look at and evaluate. On a personal level, it has a lot going for it. There is an almost 3D depth to this that is quite remarkable - almost like a green screen shot from a fantasy epic movie.  I also like the way the greens and earth tones are handled in this. It''s a brilliant image if you take the time and really look at it - some may not have the patience. Its one of those images where the WOW factor doesn''t come into play - it''s a contemplative piece much like a En plein air painting. I like this a lot. Well done.</td>', 'An image that takes some time to look at and evaluate. On a personal level, it has a lot going for it. There is an almost 3D depth to this that is quite remarkable - almost like a green screen shot from a fantasy epic movie.  I also like the way the greens and earth tones are handled in this. It''s a brilliant image if you take the time and really look at it - some may not have the patience. Its one of those images where the WOW factor doesn''t come into play - it''s a contemplative piece much like a En plein air painting. I like this a lot. Well done.', '2013-02-06 11:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973356, 1051304, 23484, '<td valign="top">Fantastic contrast. Love the bright natural lighting.</td>', 'Fantastic contrast. Love the bright natural lighting.', '2013-02-06 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
