(6973492, 1052197, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a huge WOW factor here - amazing image. The back light was a brilliant observation in particular considering the subject.  The flat tones and intricate detail just add to the image''s quality presentation. One of my favs in this challenge so far. Well done.</td>', 'There is a huge WOW factor here - amazing image. The back light was a brilliant observation in particular considering the subject.  The flat tones and intricate detail just add to the image''s quality presentation. One of my favs in this challenge so far. Well done.', '2013-02-06 14:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973498, 1051579, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a great image if only for the mystery - above the cloud deck or is that surface fog?  Really like the contrast between the blue and the earth tones. Very nice entry into the challenge - well done.</td>', 'This is a great image if only for the mystery - above the cloud deck or is that surface fog?  Really like the contrast between the blue and the earth tones. Very nice entry into the challenge - well done.', '2013-02-06 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973500, 1050491, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I like more. A little more detail on the head of the Lady Bug would enhance the overall feel of the image. Still, a great deal of detail to be had.  Good entry - I like it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what I like more. A little more detail on the head of the Lady Bug would enhance the overall feel of the image. Still, a great deal of detail to be had.  Good entry - I like it.', '2013-02-06 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973505, 1049779, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too much light, not enough detail to really rate it higher.  I do like the colored light effect on the water - the whites seem to be just over the edge of blown out - a little less heat on the white would have been better I think. Still, the overall effect is pleasing - a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Too much light, not enough detail to really rate it higher.  I do like the colored light effect on the water - the whites seem to be just over the edge of blown out - a little less heat on the white would have been better I think. Still, the overall effect is pleasing - a good entry into the challenge.', '2013-02-06 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973510, 1049632, 101256, '<td valign="top">You''re going to hate me for this comment, but there is one significant flaw and unfortunately it''s right smack dab in the middle of the image - the dark eye. Sadly, when you see one flaw, you automatically look for others and there is one - top of the nose. I originally thought it might be a speck of dirt on my monitor, but it''s not. Other than those two things, this is a spectacular image - just as you would expect for a wedding picture.</td>', 'You''re going to hate me for this comment, but there is one significant flaw and unfortunately it''s right smack dab in the middle of the image - the dark eye. Sadly, when you see one flaw, you automatically look for others and there is one - top of the nose. I originally thought it might be a speck of dirt on my monitor, but it''s not. Other than those two things, this is a spectacular image - just as you would expect for a wedding picture.', '2013-02-06 14:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973517, 1050280, 32802, '<td valign="top">Is this St. Matiin.  I remember going there and planes got this close.  Crazy!</td>', 'Is this St. Matiin.  I remember going there and planes got this close.  Crazy!', '2013-02-06 14:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973518, 1051396, 108580, '<td valign="top">Seascapes are panacea on DPC but this is superb and different. Even with a massive highlight in the middle that is getting 2''s and 3''s I''m countering that with a 7. Shoot more like this please.</td>', 'Seascapes are panacea on DPC but this is superb and different. Even with a massive highlight in the middle that is getting 2''s and 3''s I''m countering that with a 7. Shoot more like this please.', '2013-02-06 14:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973519, 1052059, 108580, '<td valign="top">Love these birds. My favourites since I was abut oh 10? Lovely group interaction. Story time?</td>', 'Love these birds. My favourites since I was abut oh 10? Lovely group interaction. Story time?', '2013-02-06 14:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973520, 1051908, 32802, '<td valign="top">I hope it isnt just my monitor but when the green trees are Blueish it ruins an otherwise beautiful picture.</td>', 'I hope it isnt just my monitor but when the green trees are Blueish it ruins an otherwise beautiful picture.', '2013-02-06 14:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973524, 1049462, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow. Double Wow. I am hot and cold over this image. Simply love the minimalism in the work and the colours, but the framing, I''m sorry it''s just ugh. A simplistic minimal outer white 5px frame would have complemented the photo...I can''t justify a fair vote...the frame is OTT.</td>', 'Wow. Double Wow. I am hot and cold over this image. Simply love the minimalism in the work and the colours, but the framing, I''m sorry it''s just ugh. A simplistic minimal outer white 5px frame would have complemented the photo...I can''t justify a fair vote...the frame is OTT.', '2013-02-06 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973525, 1051998, 108580, '<td valign="top">Not too shabby, The "look" is spot on. Good cam control.</td>', 'Not too shabby, The "look" is spot on. Good cam control.', '2013-02-06 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
