(6973546, 1050680, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a very good pose for these beautiful animals. Unfortunately, the white just seems a little over done which affects the rest of the image - in particular the white blase on the right hand horse.  Still, a very nice capture - good eye.</td>', 'This is a very good pose for these beautiful animals. Unfortunately, the white just seems a little over done which affects the rest of the image - in particular the white blase on the right hand horse.  Still, a very nice capture - good eye.', '2013-02-06 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973547, 1050034, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice conversion - I like the tunnel effect very much. The light to dark scaling is dead on. Good job - a good entry into the Challenge.</td>', 'Very nice conversion - I like the tunnel effect very much. The light to dark scaling is dead on. Good job - a good entry into the Challenge.', '2013-02-06 15:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973549, 1051776, 101256, '<td valign="top">I would like to propose this as a Top Ten image if not a Top Five. There is just so much grace and detail here that I could look at it for hours. Wonderful image - well done.</td>', 'I would like to propose this as a Top Ten image if not a Top Five. There is just so much grace and detail here that I could look at it for hours. Wonderful image - well done.', '2013-02-06 15:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973551, 1052050, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1.<br/>Only giving out one ten in the entire challenge. This is it. <br/>Reminds me of the famous Pulitzer prize photo by <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kevin_Carter" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kevin Carter</a>. After seeing this image, I immediately lowered every other photo by one because this had to be the sole 10 in the challenge. <br/> <br/>There''s something simply compelling about this image. What will his future hold? I don''t know, but it looks bleak. <br/> <br/>I might have titled it something different, but that''s irrelevant.</td>', '#1.Only giving out one ten in the entire challenge. This is it. Reminds me of the famous Pulitzer prize photo by Kevin Carter. After seeing this image, I immediately lowered every other photo by one because this had to be the sole 10 in the challenge.  There''s something simply compelling about this image. What will his future hold? I don''t know, but it looks bleak.  I might have titled it something different, but that''s irrelevant.', '2013-02-06 15:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973552, 1051814, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very candid image - there seems to be a great deal of humanity in this image - almost Franciscan if you will. Good composition and capture. Well done.</td>', 'A very candid image - there seems to be a great deal of humanity in this image - almost Franciscan if you will. Good composition and capture. Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973555, 1052056, 101256, '<td valign="top">Dude - Claude Monet is alive and well and posting on DP Challenge!! I have never seen an homage to Monet done as well as this - an amazing impressionist image - I love it. If it were up to me, the contest would be over and this would take the top prize. Well done.</td>', 'Dude - Claude Monet is alive and well and posting on DP Challenge!! I have never seen an homage to Monet done as well as this - an amazing impressionist image - I love it. If it were up to me, the contest would be over and this would take the top prize. Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973556, 1051268, 101256, '<td valign="top">The conversion is over done - the blotchy blacks against the whites just aren''t effective.  If the shadows and highlights had been handled better, this would have been a Top Five contender.</td>', 'The conversion is over done - the blotchy blacks against the whites just aren''t effective.  If the shadows and highlights had been handled better, this would have been a Top Five contender.', '2013-02-06 15:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973557, 1051106, 101256, '<td valign="top">The soft focus doesn''t help this image any. A fairly routine image which could have used a lot sharper focus to be really impressive.</td>', 'The soft focus doesn''t help this image any. A fairly routine image which could have used a lot sharper focus to be really impressive.', '2013-02-06 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973560, 1049500, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a certain dignity and grace to this image that is reminiscent of Ansel Adam''s famous image "Aspens". Not to put too fine a point on it, but the conversion is a little heavier than I would like, but that''s a nit pick. Well done.</td>', 'There is a certain dignity and grace to this image that is reminiscent of Ansel Adam''s famous image "Aspens". Not to put too fine a point on it, but the conversion is a little heavier than I would like, but that''s a nit pick. Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973561, 1051932, 101256, '<td valign="top">There isn''t a whole hell of a lot to say about this image - perfect in every way. A terrific capture and a great composition. Well done.</td>', 'There isn''t a whole hell of a lot to say about this image - perfect in every way. A terrific capture and a great composition. Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973564, 1052217, 101256, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this could use a little more color saturation as it seems a little washed out. Otherwise, the composition nicely framed and gives an impression of the Colonial era.</td>', 'In my opinion, this could use a little more color saturation as it seems a little washed out. Otherwise, the composition nicely framed and gives an impression of the Colonial era.', '2013-02-06 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973565, 1049955, 101256, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if this is over saturated or not. Because I really like the overall impact of this image, I''m going with not. Good eye, great exposure, nice capture.</td>', 'I can''t decide if this is over saturated or not. Because I really like the overall impact of this image, I''m going with not. Good eye, great exposure, nice capture.', '2013-02-06 15:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973576, 1052021, 101256, '<td valign="top">I stopped commenting on all the images because it just got to be too much. But I am commentating on those I really like and this is one of them. Terrific conversion, wonderful composition. Well done.</td>', 'I stopped commenting on all the images because it just got to be too much. But I am commentating on those I really like and this is one of them. Terrific conversion, wonderful composition. Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973584, 1050281, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is just a wonderful image - I can''t believe the depth and detail in the kimono. Unbelievable.  Terrific is all I can say. Well done.</td>', 'This is just a wonderful image - I can''t believe the depth and detail in the kimono. Unbelievable.  Terrific is all I can say. Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973586, 1052102, 101256, '<td valign="top">The single most painted and photographed spot on the planet.  Used to live about a block from this very spot.</td>', 'The single most painted and photographed spot on the planet.  Used to live about a block from this very spot.', '2013-02-06 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973588, 1050041, 101256, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for HDR images as they tend to be over done, but this is incredible and nearly perfect.  Well done.</td>', 'I don''t really care for HDR images as they tend to be over done, but this is incredible and nearly perfect.  Well done.', '2013-02-06 15:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973590, 1050704, 100393, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1051747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Awarded for Best Of 2012<br/> <br/> <br/>This is a new comment series for me, so please bear with me while I find my style!<br/> <br/>(Voted earlier)<br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. It''s a magic moment and you John have a habit of being able to find them. I believe Don asked you before (in relation to this shot) if you were a witch. It''s a fair question!<br/> <br/>2. The compositional elements are so good as to defy the candid nature of the shot - her expression, the multiple birds, the telephone-line-perch, the curious/hopeful cat, the repeating window pattern, the strong vertical lines and the dappled render of the building.<br/> <br/>3. Your characteristic glowy sharpness is present as ever, I''ve tried to emulate and always failed. You''ve even shared the settings, but mine never look like this.<br/> <br/>4. I''m returning to the verticals - I presume you perspective corrected this - it''s made a difference; it is clean and neat.<br/> <br/>But overall, it''s the magic you bring in putting it all together. A great photo is one that is more than the sum of its parts. You manage to pull that off often, but here you have outdone yourself.<br/> <br/>Bravo.</td>', '  Awarded for Best Of 2012  This is a new comment series for me, so please bear with me while I find my style! (Voted earlier) This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. It''s a magic moment and you John have a habit of being able to find them. I believe Don asked you before (in relation to this shot) if you were a witch. It''s a fair question! 2. The compositional elements are so good as to defy the candid nature of the shot - her expression, the multiple birds, the telephone-line-perch, the curious/hopeful cat, the repeating window pattern, the strong vertical lines and the dappled render of the building. 3. Your characteristic glowy sharpness is present as ever, I''ve tried to emulate and always failed. You''ve even shared the settings, but mine never look like this. 4. I''m returning to the verticals - I presume you perspective corrected this - it''s made a difference; it is clean and neat. But overall, it''s the magic you bring in putting it all together. A great photo is one that is more than the sum of its parts. You manage to pull that off often, but here you have outdone yourself. Bravo.', '2013-02-06 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973591, 1049562, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another Monet style impressionist image. Terrific. Well done.</td>', 'Another Monet style impressionist image. Terrific. Well done.', '2013-02-06 16:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
