(6973759, 1049692, 101581, '<td valign="top">I am really not the best person to critique your work as I''m still very much a novice myself.<br/>I just feel that this will do well and I want to let you know why I scored it as a 6<br/>Although the colours, tones and composition is superb, for me there just isn''t enough of a focal point or interest in the image.<br/>Also I think the horizon is slightly off, but that''s just a small point.<br/>That''s not to say it isn''t a superb shot and one that I''m sure will be right up there at the end.<br/>I just felt that this was so good I wanted to explain my 6 to you rather than slink off without an explanation.<br/>But like I say, I wish I could capture a shot like this and begin to PP this in this way. It''s just a subjective view.<br/> <br/>Thanks and good luck!</td>', 'I am really not the best person to critique your work as I''m still very much a novice myself.I just feel that this will do well and I want to let you know why I scored it as a 6Although the colours, tones and composition is superb, for me there just isn''t enough of a focal point or interest in the image.Also I think the horizon is slightly off, but that''s just a small point.That''s not to say it isn''t a superb shot and one that I''m sure will be right up there at the end.I just felt that this was so good I wanted to explain my 6 to you rather than slink off without an explanation.But like I say, I wish I could capture a shot like this and begin to PP this in this way. It''s just a subjective view. Thanks and good luck!', '2013-02-06 19:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
