(6974170, 1052102, 43463, '<td valign="top">Pete threw on his gear with care looking up from the trunk of his car to check  what was happening on the tall ship. He had overslept from working long on the nightshift and worried that he would not get to the docks in time for the photo shoot. The interview was fine as that was set-up to occur a half hour from now. But he wanted to arrive on time to get pictures of the crew hoisting the sails or in the very least a shot of one climbing up the masts.  Pete got all his gear and closed the trunk of his car. The ship was a beauty - shame it was only here for another week as that he wished he had time off to take advantage of the 2 hour sail tour they offered At brisk walk to the docks he noticed what maybe two crewman in blue standing near the ship. He quickened his pace least he miss a photo opportunity.</td>', 'Pete threw on his gear with care looking up from the trunk of his car to check  what was happening on the tall ship. He had overslept from working long on the nightshift and worried that he would not get to the docks in time for the photo shoot. The interview was fine as that was set-up to occur a half hour from now. But he wanted to arrive on time to get pictures of the crew hoisting the sails or in the very least a shot of one climbing up the masts.  Pete got all his gear and closed the trunk of his car. The ship was a beauty - shame it was only here for another week as that he wished he had time off to take advantage of the 2 hour sail tour they offered At brisk walk to the docks he noticed what maybe two crewman in blue standing near the ship. He quickened his pace least he miss a photo opportunity.', '2013-02-07 10:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
