(6974181, 1049990, 43463, '<td valign="top">She only had enough to buy one bowl of hot noodles. Xiao-niao''s tummy rumbled with hunger as she gazed  at all the food. This small bowl would be lunch and dinner for her and her sister. Bàba only had enough to feed them the one meal a day. <br/>Mei had noticed the young girl had been coming to her booth quite a bit lately. Money had grown tight with many families of late. She heard the growl of hunger come from this bird of a girl.   Mei was not that much better off but she let out a sigh as she spooned an extra scoop of noodles into the bowl. She knew she might come to regret it later if word of her kindness got out. Others would come, expecting the same. But at least for today, Xiao and her sister would have a bit more to eat.</td>', 'She only had enough to buy one bowl of hot noodles. Xiao-niao''s tummy rumbled with hunger as she gazed  at all the food. This small bowl would be lunch and dinner for her and her sister. Bàba only had enough to feed them the one meal a day. Mei had noticed the young girl had been coming to her booth quite a bit lately. Money had grown tight with many families of late. She heard the growl of hunger come from this bird of a girl.   Mei was not that much better off but she let out a sigh as she spooned an extra scoop of noodles into the bowl. She knew she might come to regret it later if word of her kindness got out. Others would come, expecting the same. But at least for today, Xiao and her sister would have a bit more to eat.', '2013-02-07 10:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
