(6974839, 1051906, 43463, '<td valign="top">Alone in the corner,<br/>Pale, pink and bare<br/>sat old Miss Mary''s chair.<br/>Long had it cradled her<br/>as the many decades passed.<br/>Be it knitting, reading, <br/>or even eating curds &amp; whey,<br/>it was her comfortable <br/>space to just sit.<br/>It is now empty for <br/>Mary Muffet is gone.<br/>The spiders no longer<br/>frightened and swept away,<br/>begin to weave cobwebs<br/>as the dust settles.</td>', 'Alone in the corner,Pale, pink and baresat old Miss Mary''s chair.Long had it cradled heras the many decades passed.Be it knitting, reading, or even eating curds & whey,it was her comfortable space to just sit.It is now empty for Mary Muffet is gone.The spiders no longerfrightened and swept away,begin to weave cobwebsas the dust settles.', '2013-02-07 22:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
