(6975004, 1051712, 136235, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Wonderfully journalistic; a story more than a photo. Processing is spot on- I love the dark bodies in the water. It looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60915" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nixter</a> to me.. Definitely a 10</td>', 'Excellent. Wonderfully journalistic; a story more than a photo. Processing is spot on- I love the dark bodies in the water. It looks like a  nixter to me.. Definitely a 10', '2013-02-07 23:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
