(6975134, 1049777, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ve given this a 7.    It''s fabulously lit and the colors are... magnificent.  Brilliant image with that contrast against the black...  *contented sigh*<br/> <br/>I''m not a prude, but the "nudeness" detracts (for me) from the beautiful model and the fabulous light.<br/>I think with some filmy upper cloth, this could be a 10.<br/> <br/>I''d really like to hear what you think the nakedness brought to the image.<br/> <br/>(feel free to message me, if you like) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment and the consequent discussion, it was really interesting and you made me think.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: I''ve given this a 7.    It''s fabulously lit and the colors are... magnificent.  Brilliant image with that contrast against the black...  *contented sigh* I''m not a prude, but the "nudeness" detracts (for me) from the beautiful model and the fabulous light.I think with some filmy upper cloth, this could be a 10. I''d really like to hear what you think the nakedness brought to the image. (feel free to message me, if you like)   Thanks for the comment and the consequent discussion, it was really interesting and you made me think.', '2013-02-08 01:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
