(6975332, 1050280, 97225, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot. I saw that airport on ''World''s Scariest Airports'' or some such - it would sure scare the heck out of me, whether I was in the plane or on the beach. What I find so fascinating is the unconcern of the beach crowd. They must quickly get used to it.</td>', 'Incredible shot. I saw that airport on ''World''s Scariest Airports'' or some such - it would sure scare the heck out of me, whether I was in the plane or on the beach. What I find so fascinating is the unconcern of the beach crowd. They must quickly get used to it.', '2013-02-08 06:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
