(6975351, 1049489, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dougi555:</b></div><hr/><i> over saturated............... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for your comment, but this image matches what I saw with my eyes.  Those who live at sea level will have never seen this kind of atmospheric event.  I''m standing at 9500'' above sea level.  The cloud is 35 miles away and reaches up to 40,000 feet.</td>', 'Originally posted by dougi555: over saturated...............  Thanks for your comment, but this image matches what I saw with my eyes.  Those who live at sea level will have never seen this kind of atmospheric event.  I''m standing at 9500'' above sea level.  The cloud is 35 miles away and reaches up to 40,000 feet.', '2013-02-08 07:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
