(6975361, 1050704, 59029, '<td valign="top">Love the story here, great shot.  Grats on the blue!</td>', 'Love the story here, great shot.  Grats on the blue!', '2013-02-08 07:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975362, 1049931, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Great job on exposure.  I especially like the view into the bottom of the river.  Not sure I can see the kayaks on the beach.  nevertheless, it''s the geology and light which is the subject.   9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The kayaks are kind of hard to see but they were added n the title to help people understand the true size of the scene. For anyone who can not tell for sure there is a small beach near the center in the lower  section of the photo, those little specs are kayaks. It is an awesome sight and if you do not like heights it can be pretty intimidating.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: Great job on exposure.  I especially like the view into the bottom of the river.  Not sure I can see the kayaks on the beach.  nevertheless, it''s the geology and light which is the subject.   9   The kayaks are kind of hard to see but they were added n the title to help people understand the true size of the scene. For anyone who can not tell for sure there is a small beach near the center in the lower  section of the photo, those little specs are kayaks. It is an awesome sight and if you do not like heights it can be pretty intimidating.', '2013-02-08 07:26:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975365, 1051114, 59029, '<td valign="top">Love the determination in her tiny little figure as she heads off into the great unknown with only a camera.  Go girl!  And congrats on the red, you deserve it for the capture of this wonderful spirit.</td>', 'Love the determination in her tiny little figure as she heads off into the great unknown with only a camera.  Go girl!  And congrats on the red, you deserve it for the capture of this wonderful spirit.', '2013-02-08 07:28:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975366, 1051449, 113156, '<td valign="top">Makes me think security or what we think is security, the tiny little world we''ve built to protect ourselves from the impermanence of it all, shame it won''t last either. Wonderful image Johanna.</td>', 'Makes me think security or what we think is security, the tiny little world we''ve built to protect ourselves from the impermanence of it all, shame it won''t last either. Wonderful image Johanna.', '2013-02-08 07:31:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975367, 1049777, 59029, '<td valign="top">Gorgeously lit nude, so glad to see she ribboned despite the site prudes.  Grats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Gorgeously lit nude, so glad to see she ribboned despite the site prudes.  Grats on the ribbon!', '2013-02-08 07:31:29.000000', NULL, 0),
