(6975369, 1049807, 59029, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous tones and great capture - and sooo close to a ribbon - dang!  But 4th in a Best of aint nothin to sneeze at either!  Huge congrats on the HM kiddo!!</td>', 'Gorgeous tones and great capture - and sooo close to a ribbon - dang!  But 4th in a Best of aint nothin to sneeze at either!  Huge congrats on the HM kiddo!!', '2013-02-08 07:34:35.000000', NULL, 0),
