(6975428, 1051658, 61961, '<td valign="top">Ken, this is one of the few photos in the challenge that didn''t make me puke.  OK, I exagerate, but it <i>is</i> one of my favorites.  I had meant to come back and bump it up but ran out of time.  Sorry it didn''t do better.  I love it.</td>', 'Ken, this is one of the few photos in the challenge that didn''t make me puke.  OK, I exagerate, but it is one of my favorites.  I had meant to come back and bump it up but ran out of time.  Sorry it didn''t do better.  I love it.', '2013-02-08 09:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975429, 1051906, 61961, '<td valign="top">You found beauty in the mundane.  The HDR worked well for this subject.</td>', 'You found beauty in the mundane.  The HDR worked well for this subject.', '2013-02-08 09:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975430, 1050704, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s wonderful that this one came out on top. Easily the best storytelling of the year :-)</td>', 'It''s wonderful that this one came out on top. Easily the best storytelling of the year :-)', '2013-02-08 09:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975431, 1051114, 30861, '<td valign="top">Terrific! That''s a VERY evocative image :-)</td>', 'Terrific! That''s a VERY evocative image :-)', '2013-02-08 09:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975433, 1049555, 61961, '<td valign="top">Unique entry, it really struck me.  I like the rather harsh, candid quality.</td>', 'Unique entry, it really struck me.  I like the rather harsh, candid quality.', '2013-02-08 09:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975435, 1051862, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think anything that can be labeled as wedding photography has a tough go in these challenges.  It''s an appealing shot, even without knowing the people.  Something touching about the boy''s crooked glasses, and the bride''s smile is lovely and genuine.</td>', 'I think anything that can be labeled as wedding photography has a tough go in these challenges.  It''s an appealing shot, even without knowing the people.  Something touching about the boy''s crooked glasses, and the bride''s smile is lovely and genuine.', '2013-02-08 09:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975436, 1051663, 61961, '<td valign="top">So underrated by voters.</td>', 'So underrated by voters.', '2013-02-08 09:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975440, 1051664, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought it was unfortunate/interesting that the shadow on the landscape in the distance looks like it was cast by the tree.  It all seems a bit cramped, and the frame contributes to that impression.</td>', 'I thought it was unfortunate/interesting that the shadow on the landscape in the distance looks like it was cast by the tree.  It all seems a bit cramped, and the frame contributes to that impression.', '2013-02-08 09:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975442, 1051582, 61961, '<td valign="top">As posthumous said in his comment, color and energy!</td>', 'As posthumous said in his comment, color and energy!', '2013-02-08 09:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975445, 1052108, 61961, '<td valign="top">I see him very often in midtown, sometimes at an outdoor table, but I''ve never taken his photo.  Might have been better in color with that preternaturally colored hair. :-)</td>', 'I see him very often in midtown, sometimes at an outdoor table, but I''ve never taken his photo.  Might have been better in color with that preternaturally colored hair. :-)', '2013-02-08 09:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975447, 1049595, 61961, '<td valign="top">Soft and delicate in a nice way, so the frame seems a heavy, contradictory addition.</td>', 'Soft and delicate in a nice way, so the frame seems a heavy, contradictory addition.', '2013-02-08 09:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975448, 1049807, 108580, '<td valign="top">Awesome result. 7.1x in effectively a Free Study is huge. WD.</td>', 'Awesome result. 7.1x in effectively a Free Study is huge. WD.', '2013-02-08 09:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975450, 1050094, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought it was quite clear from her expression that you caught her just as it registered you were taking the photo.  Quite natural and wistful expression (and yup, she is beautiful).</td>', 'I thought it was quite clear from her expression that you caught her just as it registered you were taking the photo.  Quite natural and wistful expression (and yup, she is beautiful).', '2013-02-08 09:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975453, 1049645, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought it might be a yearbook photo, and it''s an excellent one.  <i>Any</i> client would be happy with this result.</td>', 'I thought it might be a yearbook photo, and it''s an excellent one.  Any client would be happy with this result.', '2013-02-08 09:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975457, 1050748, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very funny, the arrangement is so perfect I thought it might be posed.</td>', 'Very funny, the arrangement is so perfect I thought it might be posed.', '2013-02-08 09:43:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975461, 1050830, 61961, '<td valign="top">Creepy.  I only gave it a six but as I go through the challenge results I feel like I severely underrated it.</td>', 'Creepy.  I only gave it a six but as I go through the challenge results I feel like I severely underrated it.', '2013-02-08 09:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975463, 1051936, 61961, '<td valign="top">Posthumous summed it up perfectly (again).  I''m curious to know if the eyes are lit naturally or if you lightened them in post-processing.</td>', 'Posthumous summed it up perfectly (again).  I''m curious to know if the eyes are lit naturally or if you lightened them in post-processing.', '2013-02-08 09:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
