(6975588, 1050861, 100831, '<td valign="top">I did NOT spend enough time with these best of pictures... this is such an exceptional crop and view... the details, the colors, really really nice. There are many things to remark on here, but I like the light post with the statue behind it, both standing so straight and tall. America, America.</td>', 'I did NOT spend enough time with these best of pictures... this is such an exceptional crop and view... the details, the colors, really really nice. There are many things to remark on here, but I like the light post with the statue behind it, both standing so straight and tall. America, America.', '2013-02-08 12:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
