(6975836, 1049777, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Paul, on winning the yellow in such stiff competition! This image so well deserves the recognition. It is a beautiful work of art. The model is beautiful; the lighting is exquisite; the colors and contrast are rich; and the pose and drape are graceful and sensuous without being lewd. I really like the diagonal composition and balance, and the details of the wallpaper and chair that gradually emerge from the darkness. Bravo!</td>', 'Congratulations, Paul, on winning the yellow in such stiff competition! This image so well deserves the recognition. It is a beautiful work of art. The model is beautiful; the lighting is exquisite; the colors and contrast are rich; and the pose and drape are graceful and sensuous without being lewd. I really like the diagonal composition and balance, and the details of the wallpaper and chair that gradually emerge from the darkness. Bravo!', '2013-02-08 20:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6975842, 1049986, 150479, '<td valign="top">I found this near Bear Butte, SD.  As I was checking to see which angle to take the picture, wanting more of the Butte, there was a HUGE white tank sitting in the middle of the view :(  I am very happy with how my first non-snapshot photo turned out.</td>', 'I found this near Bear Butte, SD.  As I was checking to see which angle to take the picture, wanting more of the Butte, there was a HUGE white tank sitting in the middle of the view :(  I am very happy with how my first non-snapshot photo turned out.', '2013-02-08 21:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
