(6975863, 1052211, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very dramatic. I like the converging lines of the road and trees, and the texture of the pavers. The image has an abstract feel even though all the elements are recognizable. It''s all very confusing and organized at the same time, which creates a nice tension. And of course, the color!!!! Terrific.</td>', 'Wow! Very dramatic. I like the converging lines of the road and trees, and the texture of the pavers. The image has an abstract feel even though all the elements are recognizable. It''s all very confusing and organized at the same time, which creates a nice tension. And of course, the color!!!! Terrific.', '2013-02-08 22:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
