(6975910, 1049489, 29011, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if certain displays have their contrast set to high it might also saturate the colors more than intended. I do believe what you''re saying and appreciate the write up / description. As I''ve yet to travel that high above sea level to see those colors and also have read from others of how blue skies appear more than real in certain places. Congrats on the EPOD placement.</td>', 'Perhaps if certain displays have their contrast set to high it might also saturate the colors more than intended. I do believe what you''re saying and appreciate the write up / description. As I''ve yet to travel that high above sea level to see those colors and also have read from others of how blue skies appear more than real in certain places. Congrats on the EPOD placement.', '2013-02-08 23:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
